## ActionType: 关联符合条件的商品与品牌

满足商品和品牌两端适用条件后，建立商品的品牌归属。

### Operation Config

```yaml
operation_config:
  type: relation
  relation_type_id: rel_product_brand
  relation_operation: create
  anchor_role: source
  other_object_condition:
    object_type_id: brand
    field: country
    operation: ==
    value_from: const
    value: 中国
```


### Bound Object

| Bound Object |
|--------------|
| product |

### Trigger Condition

```yaml
object_type_id: product
field: status
operation: ==
value_from: const
value: offline
```


